  "title": "Erdős Problem #394",
  "statement": {
    "representation": "markdown-latex",
    "text": "Let $t_k(n)$ denote the least $m$ such that $ n\\mid m(m+1)(m+2)\\cdots (m+k-1). $ Is it true that $ \\sum_{n\\leq x}t_2(n)\\ll \\frac{x^2}{(\\log x)^c} $ for some $c>0$?\nIs it true that, for $k\\geq 2$, $ \\sum_{n\\leq x}t_{k+1}(n) =o\\left(\\sum_{n\\leq x}t_k(n)\\right)? $ ",
